{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"The main defects are concentrated in the review controller/service: the public DTO currently populates a full customer object, writes invalid status codes, and the service incrementally adjusts averages so edits/deletes cannot be correct. I’m tightening those boundaries and recalculating aggregates from the actual review rows after each mutation."}}
